<title>GERMANY: SCHENKER NAMES MALAYSIA, KOREA MANAGERS.</title>
<headline>SCHENKER NAMES MALAYSIA, KOREA MANAGERS.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freight forwarder Schenker International AG has named new managers for its Malaysia subsidiaries, the company's in-house newspaper said.</p>
<p>Wolfgang Laabs took over as managing director of Schenker International Malaysia on August 1, the publication reported.</p>
<p>Martin Bongard is the new president of Schenker International Korea Ltd, it added. -Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017 -www.racs.com</p>
